{# Which price list am I looking at? The two lists live on separate pages, so
   without this a business visitor reads home prices without realising. Rendered
   as links rather than tabs: each state has its own URL, so it can be shared,
   bookmarked and found in search. aria-current marks the one you are on. #}
<nav class="price-switch" aria-label="Choose a price list">
  <a href="/fixed-prices/"{% if page.url == "/fixed-prices/" %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>For your home</a>
  <a href="/business-fixed-prices/"{% if page.url == "/business-fixed-prices/" %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>For your business</a>
</nav>
